# Data licensing

Code in this repository is MIT (see LICENSE). Data artifacts are separate.

## AIT Log Data Set V2.1 — CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

Source: https://zenodo.org/records/19483937 (Landauer et al.)

ShareAlike propagates to adapted material, so derived Parquet feature tables,
template vocabularies and caches are adaptations subject to the same licence, and
NonCommercial forecloses commercial use.

**Policy: derived AIT features are NOT redistributed.** They are regenerated locally
from the original download. This keeps the code permissively licensed without
ShareAlike propagating into it.

## UNSW-NB15 — academic use only

Commercial use prohibited; redistribution requires author agreement. Used only in the
pooled negative control for the provenance diagnostic. **Never redistributed in any
form, including derived rows.**

## CIC-IDS2017, Engelen/WTMC-2021 corrected release

Licence not stated on the distribution site. To be resolved before use; until then
the manifest records the entry as licence-unknown. Cite Engelen, Rimmer & Joosen,
WTMC 2021.

## Substitution-refusal rule

If a corrected dataset variant cannot be obtained, the manifest records it as
`unobtainable`. The uncorrected original is never silently substituted, because doing
so would invalidate the comparison it was chosen for.
